description: shadcn/ui bases in shared/ui keep the registry source verbatim — one style, Radix structure, data-slot attributes, and the registry's own open/close motion. Closed-set props are exported constants.
globs: ["**/shared/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "**/components.json", "**/globals.css"]
alwaysApply: false
